      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S PEAKIN' (8) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 9 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 34.26. Outside box to overcome but goes well at this distance. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. GINNY'S RUN (6) goes very well here starting six times for two wins and two minors. Below best last time at this track (31.38) in a OPEN, finishing a 10 length sixth. Can feature with the right run. SCOTT SCOTCH (7) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (38.69) in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Should be in this for a long way. MANIFESTO (3) comes into calculations after placing out of the same box most recently.",
